        "text_preview": "\nTherefore, custodial interrogation of the petitioners is not required in this matter."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b793ae702c34489f854cb22b62800a3b_13",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, this third application for pre-arrest bail cannot be entertained."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ec2df03fa1bf4c2cabd2dcc346dd2cf5_15",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "First bail application of the petitioners was dismissed as not pressed on 12.01.2024."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e15ad61d48c1437bb0f2049e2c16831a_16",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thereafter,\nsecond bail application was filed without any change in circumstances and same was considered and dismissed on 26.02.2024 by this Court with the observation that after rejection of first bail application, there was no substantia"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3a6206fbe8bb4b658f243ff7af6ce23b_17",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Now, this third pre-arrest bail application has been preferred on the basis of an information received on 19.03.2024."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "553fe60863f447ec887b263d53bbe30a_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "From bare perusal of the information dated 19.03.2024, it appears that same is based on an earlier report dated 20.02.2024, while second bail application was considered and dismissed on 26.02.2024,\nsubsequent to the report dated 20.02.2024."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cfd50648c9644bfebebb0ae8eef01939_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, in these circumstances, I do not find any ground to change my earlier view."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2633dcd20e97445bb7054db3f0ddd2a4_20",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Filing of the instant bail application in such a short span is abuse of process of law."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ad61798488874d0ea9ea11ecfc45fa86_22",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thus, I do not deem it a fit case for grant of anticipatory bail to the accused-petitioners."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e56fdb20fb244276a6da49d40f133d9d_23",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nAccordingly, the anticipatory bail application is dismissed."
      }
